      "writtenOn": "2020-12-10T17:41:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Flow: Ref: USB Type-C Cable and Connector Specification: fig F-1:\n\nDiscover Identity SOP\u0027 response says that the cable is superspeed.\n        |\nDiscover SVID SOP\u0027 -- No response/Doesn\u0027t support Intel SVID - Enter TBT with \n        |                                                      cable speed \nDiscover Mode SOP\u0027                                             to TBT Gen1/Gen2\n        |\nEnter TBT with speed from Discover Mode SOP\u0027\n\nThe speed from Discover identity SOP\u0027 and discover Mode SOP\u0027 is different. Identity gives info if cable supports superspeed (b2:0), Discover mode SOP\u0027 gives tbt speed(b18:16).\n\nHope this helps!",
      "parentUuid": "90bddecb_42134fcc",
